WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.550
Record a brand you are talking to: what they want, who to call and the next step.

2
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:15.350
Leads are every brand you are talking to, from the first call to the signed lease.

3
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:22.340
Ready-made views show your leads, the hot ones, deals closing soon and follow-ups that are late.

4
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:26.410
To add one, choose New lead.

5
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:32.140
Name the lead, usually the brand and the concept.

6
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:37.000
Choose the category and where the lead came from.

7
00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:45.040
Add the person you talk to and how to reach them.

8
00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:54.660
The size they want and their budget help the office suggest units that fit.

9
00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:03.130
Always write the next step and its date, so nothing is forgotten.

10
00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:06.190
Create the lead.

11
00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:13.960
The lead page shows its stage, a score out of 100, the timeline and the units that fit.
